  "continuity": "All144 domain cases pass initially. Data compilation fails only on the new NativeSessionRepository test double parameter name (id vs sessionId), treated as error by -Werror. Only that test parameter is corrected. All25 selected data cases then pass. Production/domain sources unchanged between gates.",
