    "Actual completed LEGACY fixture retains the original Matrix room/user/device/fingerprint and completion while an unmigrated peer is offboarded. Missing/altered completion suppresses without retirement; expired interactive admission is denied while exact provenance and background callback remain admitted. No native or provider token is acquired by callback.",
    "Twelve native pusher cases and two retained pusher/gateway regressions pass with the extracted completion-provenance helper; interactive wrapper keeps its original current admission/time checks."
  ],
